WEBVTT

00:00:29.076 --> 00:00:33.796
That is, three billion more people
than the planet houses today.

00:00:34.356 --> 00:00:37.156
To house all of those people,

00:00:37.156 --> 00:00:44.076
we need to build
about 2.4 trillion square feet

00:00:44.116 --> 00:00:45.716
of new built space.

00:00:46.356 --> 00:00:48.196
Now to give you a sense of scale,

00:00:48.196 --> 00:00:52.916
that is the equivalent of adding
to the planet a New York City,

00:00:52.956 --> 00:00:54.116
every month ...

00:00:54.556 --> 00:00:56.556
for the next 40 years.

00:00:57.996 --> 00:00:59.836
Now I'm a New Yorker and an architect,

00:00:59.876 --> 00:01:02.116
but this scares even me.